-- Primebrick: ScheduleSpecInput widget keys + generic archetype form keys.
--
-- `app.widgets.schedule_spec.*` — the shared ScheduleSpecInput control in
-- @primebrick/ui resolves its chrome labels through the ui i18n bridge; the
-- keys live in the canonical app.* namespace (public.translations), all 7
-- product languages (no per-key fallback exists — a missing key renders raw).
--
-- `app.common.unsavedChanges` / `app.common.loadError` — the host-rendered
-- EntityFormPage archetype is generic: its unsaved-changes confirm and load
-- error strings are the shared app.common vocabulary, not page-scoped keys.

